      "walkthrough": [
        "Substitution removes y; a repeated root imposes tangency.\nSubstitute $y = mx + 5$ into the circle equation $x^2 + y^2 = 16$:\n$$x^2 + (mx + 5)^2 = 16$$",
        "Expand and collect like terms to obtain the quadratic in $x$:\n$$x^2 + m^2x^2 + 10mx + 25 - 16 = 0$$\n$$(1 + m^2)x^2 + 10mx + 9 = 0$$"
      ]
    },
